    "missing host facts remain explicit unknowns rather than inferred truths",
    "a prior diagnostic clear result never bypasses final execution re-authorization",
    "claim release assessment does not create truth authority",
    "correction warrant does not create execution authority",
    "governed correction application requires current ACT authority",
    "participant evidence inspection requires READ and does not imply DISCLOSE"
